{"id":"f4fabcfa63f1f102","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-amalgamation-property.md","title":"thm-amalgamation-property","display":"thm-amalgamation-property","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-amalgamation]]","[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-embedding]]"],"display":"thm-amalgamation-property","label":"93-thm-amalgamation-property","aliases":["93-thm-amalgamation-property"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd15b0d34ad7970a\" href=\"?note=bd15b0d34ad7970a\" title=\"93-df-amalgamation\">93-df-amalgamation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-amalgamation-property"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-amalgamation-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-amalgamation-property</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-amalgamation-property-thm-amalgamation-property\">thm-amalgamation-property <code>thm-amalgamation-property</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}\">\\(\\mathrm{Amalgamation}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bd15b0d34ad7970a\" href=\"?note=bd15b0d34ad7970a\" title=\"93-df-amalgamation\">93-df-amalgamation</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}amalgamation\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall f,g\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\exists f&#39;,g&#39;\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f&#39;,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\\land\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g&#39;,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf D)\\land f&#39;\\circ f=g&#39;\\circ g\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}amalgamation\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall f,g\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\exists f&#39;,g&#39;\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f&#39;,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\\land\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g&#39;,\\mathbf C,\\mathbf D)\\land f&#39;\\circ f=g&#39;\\circ g\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The amalgam does not exist in every variety; its universal existence is precisely the additional property <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-amalgamation-property-thm-amalgamation-property","text":"thm-amalgamation-property `thm-amalgamation-property`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-amalgamation","status":"resolved","id":"bd15b0d34ad7970a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-amalgamation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-amalgamation","status":"resolved","id":"bd15b0d34ad7970a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Amalgamation}$ and $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ are the predicates from [[93-df-amalgamation]] and [[93-df-embedding]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Amalgamation}$ and $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ are the predicates from [[93-df-amalgamation]] and [[93-df-embedding]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}amalgamation\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\forall\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf C\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall f,g\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf C)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists\\mathbf D\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\exists f',g'\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(f',\\mathbf B,\\mathbf D)\\land\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(g',\\mathbf C,\\mathbf D)\\land f'\\circ f=g'\\circ g\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Amalgamation}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":false}],"bytes":1254,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["bd15b0d34ad7970a","f0b0edbaa6696a1d","d611f4ac8b8895ab"]}